# kin/youth/neck/torc: the youth's torc: a ring of metal2 at the collar, lit at the front left, its open ends at the
# throat (front view); rigid (the flow keys are its rest)
# KIN-YOUTH (P2b wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body youth
role neck torc
layer neck
anchor neck
keys neck

view D key rest origin 3 0
|NPP.ON

view U key rest origin 3 0
|NPOOON

view R key rest origin 2 0
|NPPON

view R key flow origin 2 0
|NPPON

view R key flow2 origin 2 0
|NPPON

view L key rest origin 3 0
|PPOON

view L key flow origin 3 0
|PPOON

view L key flow2 origin 3 0
|PPOON

view L key lie origin 3 0
|PPOON
